<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 341,Texas, won by Coastal Sec..</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 341,Texas, won by Coastal Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Securities said it won $2.775 million of Harris Cty MUD 341, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.870 percent.</p>
